#### Word of the Prophet

While the Word of the Prophet is an illuminated tome that is banned within Rokugani borders, countless copies of it circulate along the Sand Road, and some have even made their way within the Emerald Empire’s borders. The book, a collection of Qamarist stories, is the basis of worship for the Qamarist faith. It contains not only the story of the Nameless Prophet but and inscribed interpretations. When passed down as family heirlooms, they often contain family trees and mementos of family ancestors from long past. (Cost: 15 koku. Rarity: 9.)

