#### Asahina Nao

Gear (equipped): Sanctified robes (Physical 1, Supernatural 3, Ceremonial), scroll satchel, personal chop

THE FIRES FROM WITHIN (INVOCATION) As an Attack action, Nao may make a TN 3 Theology (Fire) check targeting a number of characters up to her Fire Ring at range 1–3. If she succeeds, each target suffers 3 supernatural damage, plus 1 per bonus success.

(op)+: Choose 1 additional target per (op) spent this way. PATH TO INNER PEACE (INVOCATION) As a Support action, Nao may make a TN 2 Theology (Water) check targeting herself or another character at range 0–2. If she succeeds, the target removes 3 fatigue, plus 1 per bonus success. A target can only be affected by the Path to Inner Peace invocation once per scene.

#### Ifrit

Gear (equipped): Corona of flames (Physical 3)

