(op): After a character at range 1–2 performs an Attack action targeting Kasami or another character she is guarding, Kasami may perform a Strike action with one readied Martial Arts [Melee or Unarmed] weapon targeting that character (if they are within Kasami’s weapon’s range). This effect persists until the start of Kasami’s next turn, or until Kasami performs a Strike action this way.

## Art Credits Index

Once per scene, when an Attack action check targeting another character at range 0–1 succeeds, Kasami may intervene, becoming the target of the action instead.

#### Additional Notes

- Advantage for Quick Reflexes (Fire) [Interpersonal, Physical] checks
- Disadvantage for Impatience (Earth) [Mental] checks

Kasami can always be found by Shin’s side, hand on sword ready to run a fool through. She does not like to be left outside when Shin is dealing with nobles and is quick to let Shin know exactly what she is thinking.

